{"id": "EUVD-2026-80662", "enisaUuid": "07f88f94-c215-3319-911b-1dc5fc0b3df8", "description": "yshop-crm through 2.1.3 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the CrmInvoiceController issueInvoice endpoint that allows authenticated back-office users to issue arbitrary invoices. Attackers can call the PUT /admin-api/crm/invoice/issue endpoint without required permissions to modify invoice status, inflate contract invoiced amounts with attacker-chosen values, and trigger invoice emails to arbitrary addresses.", "datePublished": "2026-09-16T11:07:27", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-21T17:50:17", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/LinYuanyi1/cve-request-poc/blob/master/yshop-crm/C03_crm_invoice_issue.py", "https://github.com/guchengwuyue/yshop-crm/blob/5f5810a0e1e4ab0828523ec299bf973c2f9065d7/yshop-crm/yshop-module-crm/yshop-module-crm-biz/src/main/java/co/yixiang/yshop/module/crm/controller/admin/crminvoice/CrmInvoiceController.java#L80", "https://github.com/guchengwuyue/yshop-crm/blob/5f5810a0e1e4ab0828523ec299bf973c2f9065d7/yshop-crm/yshop-module-crm/yshop-module-crm-biz/src/main/java/co/yixiang/yshop/module/crm/service/crminvoice/CrmInvoiceServiceImpl.java#L317", "https://github.com/guchengwuyue/yshop-crm/blob/5f5810a0e1e4ab0828523ec299bf973c2f9065d7/yshop-crm/pom.xml#L30", "https://github.com/guchengwuyue/yshop-crm", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/yshop-crm-through-2.1.3-missing-authorization-via-crminvoicecontroller-issueinvoice"], "aliases": ["GHSA-9fpf-hpfc-3v65", "CVE-2026-92457"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.43, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "75b42983-6b3c-35da-ab9d-63a6dd37d68d", "product": {"name": "yshop-crm", "vendor": {"name": "guchengwuyue"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22642.1.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "75c670bf-ca02-38b1-b48a-2f654f096324", "vendor": {"name": "guchengwuyue"}}], "isExploited": false}